oard of Governors\n# Joe Pick\nBennington Public Schools Board\n# Sändra Washington\nLincoln City Council\n# Bennie Shobe\nLincoln City Council\n# Tom Beckius\nLincoln City Council\n# Christa Yoakum\nLancaster County Commission\n# Dr. Marilyn Johnson Farr\nLincoln Board of Education\n# Bob Rauner\nLincoln Board of Education\n## Red-to-Blue Program\n## Nebraska Democratic Party\n## BLACK CAUCUS\n## Nebraska Democratic Party\n## LATINO CAUCUS\n## Sign Up To Get Involved\nFacebook\nX-twitter\nInstagram\nDenise Powell is a mom, small business owner, public school champion and healthcare advocate who knows that a strong work ethic and a love of family and community is the Nebraska way of life. She is running for Congress in Nebraska’s Second District to fight for the people of Nebraska each and every day. Support her campaign by making a donation here.\n## Paid for by Denise Powell for Congress\n## (Paid for by hardworking Americans, not Elon Musk)\n## Media Kit\n## Contributions can be mailed to:\n## Denise Powell for Congress\nPO Box 6039\nOmaha, NE 68106\n## For press inquires, please contact [email protected]. For all other inquires, please contact [email protected].\n## Copyright 2025. All rights reserved.",
